chases the next croissant.</p><p>Meet $PIGEON — the sleep-deprived, baguette-wielding menace of the Solana streets. A little dramatic. Ridiculously French. Entirely here for the memes.</p><p>No grand promises. No complicated lore. Just an iconic bird, an excellent beret, and a flock that gets it.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://x.com/LePigeonSol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YOU LOOK LIKE ONE OF US <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></a><div class=\"about-signoff\">Less thinking. More cooing.<span>— Le Pigeon</span></div></div></section><section id=\"memes\" class=\"memes-section\" aria-labelledby=\"memes-title\"><div class=\"section-container\"><div class=\"memes-heading\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-asterisk\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg> STRAIGHT FROM THE STREETS</div><h2 id=\"memes-title\">CERTIFIED<br/><span>PIGEON MOMENTS.</span></h2></div><div class=\"memes-heading-aside\"><p>Art? Maybe.<br/>A cry for help? Oui.</p><button class=\"shuffle-button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shuffle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg> SHUFFLE THE FLOCK</button></div></div><div class=\"meme-grid\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Pigeon meme gallery\"><a class=\"meme-card\" href=\"https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/pigeon_meme_2-xKc2cr4618gx3IFKQjwvVrFu8OkPHw.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Open mem